"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:03:18\", \"token_count\": 417, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-34\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Title**: Authenticated handshake for multi-site node sync\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nEnable distributed zero-trust node synchronization for multi-site local deployments, requiring an authenticated handshake between nodes. Validation of the handshake under high-latency networks failed with timeouts; the fix depends on the completed encryption work, but the task remains blocked pending resolution.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-34\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Title**: Authenticated handshake for multi-site node sync\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Authenticated node-replication handshake completes reliably between nodes.\\n\\n- Handshake succeeds under high-latency network conditions, not only nominal latency.\\n\\n- Blocking timeout issue is resolved before multi-site rollout can proceed.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-34\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Title**: Authenticated handshake for multi-site node sync\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nEnable distributed zero-trust node synchronization for multi-site local deployments, requiring an authenticated handshake between nodes. Validation of the handshake under high-latency networks failed with timeouts; the fix depends on the completed encryption work, but the task remains blocked pending resolution.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-34\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Title**: Authenticated handshake for multi-site node sync\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-04**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Opened the task because multi-site local deployments need distributed zero-trust node synchronization.*\\n\\n- **2026-09-22**: Diana - Handshake Timeout Block (Blocked)\\n\\n - *Blocked after validation showed handshake timeouts on high-latency networks; resolution depends on the encryption work but remains unresolved.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 34 sourc id src cu ciph 34 task id ciph 34 titl authent handshak for multi site node sync status block assigne bob prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 descript enabl distribut zero trust node synchron for multi site local deploy requir an authent handshak between node valid of the handshak under high latenc network fail with timeout the fix depend on the complet encrypt work but the task remain block pend resolut clickup task ciph 34 sourc id src cu ciph 34 task id ciph 34 titl authent handshak for multi site node sync status block assigne bob prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 accept criterion authent node replic handshak complet reliabl between node handshak succeed under high latenc network condit not onli nomin latenc block timeout issu is resolv befor multi site rollout can proceed clickup task ciph 34 sourc id src cu ciph 34 task id ciph 34 titl authent handshak for multi site node sync status block assigne bob prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 descript enabl distribut zero trust node synchron for multi site local deploy requir an authent handshak between node valid of the handshak under high latenc network fail with timeout the fix depend on the complet encrypt work but the task remain block pend resolut clickup task ciph 34 sourc id src cu ciph 34 task id ciph 34 titl authent handshak for multi site node sync status block assigne bob prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 activ histori 2026 08 04 alic task creat open open the task becaus multi site local deploy need distribut zero trust node synchron 2026 09 22 diana handshak timeout block block block after valid show handshak timeout on high latenc network resolut depend on the encrypt work but remain unresolv\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e993c5728a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-34-Zero-Trust-Node-Sync.md\", \"id\": \"d487d4d51c3b088f\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3331303437725822, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.20792870538940322, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6252675, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-34-Zero-Trust-Node-Sync.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e993c5728a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-34-Zero-Trust-Node-Sync.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-34-Zero-Trust-Node-Sync.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1197, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:05\", \"token_count\": 534, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-27\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Node Sync Handshake Validation\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Thread opened**: 2026-08-08\\n\\n**Last activity**: 2026-09-22\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-08-08 09:04] Bob**: Ran the handshake validation under nominal latency — two nodes on the local network, dozens of connect attempts back to back. No failures.\\n\\n**[2026-08-08 09:05] Evan**: Any dropped or retried handshakes at all?\\n\\n**[2026-08-08 09:30] Bob**: None. Every attempt authenticated cleanly on the first try at this latency.\\n\\n**[2026-08-08 09:32] Diana**: We still need the high-latency case covered before this goes anywhere near the field.\\n\\n**[2026-08-08 09:38] Bob**: Agreed, it's next on the list. First cut of the nominal-latency pass looks solid — leaving it in progress until we cover high latency.\\n\\n**[2026-08-08 09:41] Diana**: Good.\\n\\n**[2026-09-22 09:50] Diana**: Reopening this. Ran the handshake over a simulated high-latency link and it's timing out — never completes the exchange.\\n\\n**[2026-09-22 10:08] Bob**: Timing out, or actively failing? Could just be the round trip budget being too tight.\\n\\n**[2026-09-22 10:09] Diana**: Times out. And it gets worse the slower the link — feels like the handshake is doing more work per round trip than it should.\\n\\n**[2026-09-22 10:18] Bob**: That tracks. The AES-256 pipeline we added on the output path adds per-packet overhead, and on a slow link that pushes the exchange past the timeout window. This depends on the encryption work settling down before we can retest — handshake work stays blocked for now.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 27 slack thread node sync handshak valid channel cipherdoc thread open 2026 08 08 last activ 2026 09 22 2026 08 08 09 04 bob ran the handshak valid under nomin latenc two node on the local network dozen of connect attempt back to back no failur 2026 08 08 09 05 evan ani drop or retri handshak at all 2026 08 08 09 30 bob none everi attempt authent clean on the first tri at this latenc 2026 08 08 09 32 diana we still need the high latenc case cover befor this go anywher near the field 2026 08 08 09 38 bob agre it s next on the list first cut of the nomin latenc pas look solid leav it in progress until we cover high latenc 2026 08 08 09 41 diana good 2026 09 22 09 50 diana reopen this ran the handshak over a simul high latenc link and it s time out never complet the exchang 2026 09 22 10 08 bob time out or activ fail could just be the round trip budget be too tight 2026 09 22 10